00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.550
Hi, Rui-kun.

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:51.050
Do you want to go together 
to visit Rizumu-san?

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:52.110
Huh?

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.280
You hadn't finished your 
conversation with him, right?

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.720
Amnesia Effect, huh?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:11.360
I thought it might be you, Ninomiya Rui-kun.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.110
I'm Ichinose Hajime!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.820
Nice to meet you.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:15.840
And this is...

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.080
Katze!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.490
Been a while, Rizumin!

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.490
Is that you, Berg-Katze?

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.900
How you've changed.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:26.790
You're a difficult one to understand.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.840
The same goes for you, Rizumin.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:33.740
Unlike Rui-rui, even though you didn't 
budge one bit when I took out your NOTE,

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:37.150
you suddenly put on revolutionary airs! 
Talk about a 180!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:42.180
I never intended to use 
the power you gave me...

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.310
until Rui-kun there rushed 
to commit his foolish acts.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.060
I don't think of myself as foolish.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:53.350
You still delude yourself after that debacle?

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:56.730
You must know, deep down,

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:02.270
that this nation's full of apes 
who are incapable of independent thought.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:05.400
No, that's not true.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.710
The rule of 2 to 6 to 2.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:11.820
Who do the 60 percent follow in this nation?

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.600
That'd be public opinion.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.440
Japan does not have a rational society—

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:20.930
only irrational, sordid public opinion.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.230
That's why I call the masses apes.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:29.560
Even in prison, I can watch 
television at certain times.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:34.110
The smart phone prime minister elections 
are going to be interesting.

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.800
Interesting?

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.950
Why do you think former 
Prime Minister Sugayama

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:40.500
is being subjected to that much criticism?

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:46.800
Do you think everyone's personally 
aggrieved by his gaffes and mistakes?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.150
Of course not.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:54.890
Most of the people attacking 
him are not angry.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:59.160
Why are they criticizing him then? 
Attacking him?

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.970
Because that's the prevailing 
mood among the people.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.620
There's no actual reason.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.660
There's no need for rationale.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:09.920
Just because that's how the wind blows,

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.420
they'll attack the same things

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.310
and like the same things as everyone else.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.560
No.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.270
You're being a radical.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.420
No, that's the simple truth.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:23.070
At least former Prime Minister Sugayama

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.670
is only being subjected to slander 
and character defamation.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:29.380
If it had been anyone who'd committed 
a more serious offense...

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:33.050
The apes may well just say 
it's how the wind blows

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:36.210
and lynch that person using CROWDS.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.420
No.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:40.460
What if their target was a group of people?

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.340
An entire village?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.180
Another nation?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:49.260
Without individual will, the apes may 
be moved to destroy the entire world.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.390
You're wrong!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.100
I have a question.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.100
What is it?

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:58.940
So you already know who'll win 
this election, Rizumu-san?

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:00.820
Of course.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.450
1-2-3!

